e buyer is happening in China so we  cancel the trip we didn't go so even I  was trying to explain I didn't go lady  didn't believe me and assuming I has  gone to China  why do you think you in particular were  asked to leave the market for the first  so I they accused me I has gone to China  which mean I already get the virus  already secondly I don't know why they  did it to me because I thought it why  they they asked me to leave because my  identity or because my skin color the  grocer I believe there's so many big hip  hop has by the market hall so wishing  people travel from different place am I  you know am I already in fact by the  virus and there may be the skin color  did for me for did  worried about its little dollies just  only Tachyon me so lots of us make me so  upset and feeling down about this issue  I'm is Lou as far as I understand you've  been at this market for 15 years so  you're not a stranger here is that  correct no less right because I'm a  senior trader in mobility Seoul as well  as make me so upset if I attacked by a  stranger which would mean I can just  take him in and won't be told to be  upset but the trouble is is this thing  happen to me and by the people who I  work so many years so wish me I was  really shocking things to people who are  seeing this and have fears about the  spread of the corona virus what is your  message  well I just would like to appeal to  public we don't need over panic I think  we all should find the virus together  and the most important things don't  bring these fears by attacking Asian  people because that is the virus Pro is  not from these people so we should give  together help each other and respect  each other and there is no need more  attacking on anybody about this issue  miss Liu thank you very much for  speaking to us a virus that doesn't  discriminate based on race so should we  as you consider that here's advice on  how you can protect yourself against the  virus the public advice is pretty simple  but worth repeating wash your hands  frequently with soap and water  alcohol-based hand sanitizers are a good  alternative and avoid touching your eyes  nose and mouth if you do sneeze for  example or cough cover your nose and  mouth with the tissue then throw it in  the bin anyone with flu symptoms should  avoid close contact with others stay at  home if you happen to live in an area  affected by the corona virus avoid live  food markets and contact with animals  and finally avoid speech  in public while largely taboo spitting  remains common in many places and health  officials warn that spitting spreads  disease
 

